# Third-party licenses

The native extension of `verified-python` (`verified._native`) links the Rust
crates below. Their licenses require these notices and texts to accompany a
binary distribution, so this file ships in every wheel. It is generated from
`rust/Cargo.lock` by
[cargo-about](https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about) (see
`rust/about.toml`); do not edit it by hand.

This project's own license is in `LICENSE`, and its notices are in `NOTICE`.

